@startuml
[*] --> Running
Running --> Configuration : requestConfiguration
Running --> ShutDown : requestShutdown
Running --> DataCollection : clockTriggered
Running --> StatusCheck : requestStatusCheck
Configuration --> Running : configurationCompleted
DataCollection --> Running : dataCollected
StatusCheck --> Running : statusChecked
Running --> Controlled : remoteControl
Controlled --> ShutDown : requestShutdown
@enduml
